ut has no effect. ### Additional Information <img width=\\\"8\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"number\": 49475,\n   \"opened\": \"2026-01-21\",\n   \"score\": 46.9,\n   \"title\": \"Cannot save/download PDF from ASAR file in PDF viewer\",\n   \"shared_terms\": [\n    \"viewer\",\n    \"pdf\",\n    \"download\",\n    \"save\",\n    \"dialog\",\n    \"cannot\",\n    \"file\"\n   ],\n   \"already_linked_by_reporter\": false,\n   \"excerpt\": \"### Expected Behavior When viewing a PDF in the embedded PDF viewer it should be possible to save the file using the \\\"Download\\\" button. ### Actual Behavior The save dialog appears, but no file is saved after confirming the destination and file name. ### Additional Information I have created a simple ASAR file that contains a PDF to avoid having to bundle the app. Unfortunately, it is not possible \"\n  },\n  {\n   \"number\": 50657,\n   \"opened\": \"2026-04-02\",\n   \"score\": 41.5,\n   \"title\": \"Electron exited with signal SIGTRAP with PDF and disable-site-isolation-trials\",\n   \"shared_terms\": [\n    \"pdfs\",\n    \"iframes\",\n    \"pdf\",\n    \"changed\",\n    \"issue.\",\n    \"changes\",\n    \"following\",\n    \"chromium\"\n   ],\n   \"already_linked_by_reporter\": false,\n   \"excerpt\": \"### Expected Behavior The pdf is loaded and doesn't crash. Electron 40.8.5: <img width=\\\"912\\\" height=\\\"712\\\" alt=\\\"Image\\\" src=\\\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/397dd9e2-b000-416c-956f-3d391003c921\\\" /> ### Actual Behavior Electron crashes with: Electron exited with signal SIGTRAP. Electron 41.1.1: <img width=\\\"392\\\" height=\\\"86\\\" alt=\\\"Image\\\" src=\\\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/07d5115\"\n  }\n ],\n \"similar_search\": \"BM25 over issue-corpus.jsonl, only issues opened before 2026-08-28T22:02:21Z\"\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"15669784-5a9d-4b79-82d0-fe3614fffe6b","uuid":"df6f8fd6-a7c9-4fd9-ba19-4594cf15edf6","timestamp":"2026-10-23T10:02:08.5